          "id": "title",
          "parts": [
            "Sci-fi:",
            "Inventing New Worlds!"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "label": "Paragraph 1",
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p1a",
          "parts": [
            "Science fiction (sci-fi)",
            "is a type of literature",
            "and film."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p1b",
          "parts": [
            "These stories talk about",
            "imaginary or future worlds,",
            "where crazy things are possible."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p1c",
          "parts": [
            "In sci-fi books,",
            "you can read about time travel,",
            "technology, space,",
            "and other cool things."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "rocket",
          "parts": [
            "rocket"
          ],
          "kind": "caption",
          "image": "rocket"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "label": "Paragraph 2",
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p2a",
          "parts": [
            "Sometimes, years later,",
            "inventors make the ideas",
            "from sci-fi real!"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p2b",
          "parts": [
            "One of the most famous",
            "sci-fi writers",
            "is Jules Verne."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p2c",
          "parts": [
            "He wrote more than 150 years ago,",
            "before they used electricity",
            "and gasoline for transportation."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p2d",
          "parts": [
            "In his books,",
            "he predicts submarines",
            "and space rockets."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p2e",
          "parts": [
            "What do you think",
            "he would say",
            "if he could see",
            "these inventions now?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "submarine",
          "parts": [
            "submarine"
          ],
          "kind": "caption",
          "image": "submarine"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "label": "Paragraph 3",
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p3a",
          "parts": [
            "Many other writers",
            "have included ideas",
            "for futuristic inventions",
            "in their stories."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p3b",
          "parts": [
            "Look at these unusual inventions",
            "from literature and movies."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p3c",
          "parts": [
            "Which do you think",
            "would be the most useful?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p3d",
          "parts": [
            "Which would be the most fun?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p3e",
          "parts": [
            "Something you wear",
            "in your ear",
            "that allows you understand",
            "any language"
          ],
          "kind": "item"
        },
        {
          "id": "p3f",
          "parts": [
            "Smart wallpaper",
            "that makes the color",
            "of the walls change",
            "to reflect how you’re feeling"
          ],
          "kind": "item"
        },
        {
          "id": "p3g",
          "parts": [
            "A drink that makes you smaller",
            "and food that can make you",
            "grow into a giant"
          ],
          "kind": "item"
        },
        {
          "id": "wallpaper",
          "parts": [
            "wallpaper"
          ],
          "kind": "caption",
          "image": "wallpaper"
        }
      ]
    },
