            "about imaginary worlds",
            "of the future."
          ],
          "letter": "b",
          "answer": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "idea-c",
          "parts": [
            "Lots of sci-fi writers",
            "write about amazing inventions",
            "of the future."
          ],
          "letter": "c",
