            "the story is about?"
          ],
          "letter": "a"
        },
        {
          "id": "world",
          "parts": [
            "Do you think",
            "the world in the story",
            "is different from our world now?"
          ],
          "letter": "b"
        },
        {
          "id": "how",
          "parts": [
            "How?"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
